<P class="t1 on">国际双创实践周 <SPAN class="line"></SPAN></P>
<DIV class="clear"></DIV></DIV>
<DIV class="nry_con">
<DIV class="con">
<P class="tit">关于做好国际双创实践周教育教学安排的通知</P>
<P class="zd"><SPAN>2020-06-12</SPAN><SPAN>审核人：<!--</SPAN><span style="color:red;">审核人参数配置未打开</span><SPAN>-->(已浏览<script>_showDynClicks("wbnews", 1070628979, 8592)</script>)</SPAN></P>
    <div id="vsb_content" class="ny"><div class="v_news_content">
<style><!--  /* Font Definitions */  @font-face {font-family:宋体; panose-1:2 1 6 0 3 1 1 1 1 1;} @font-face {font-family:黑体; panose-1:2 1 6 9 6 1 1 1 1 1;} @font-face {font-family:"Cambria Math"; panose-1:2 4 5 3 5 4 6 3 2 4;} @font-face {font-family:仿宋_GB2312;} @font-face {font-family:方正小标宋简体;} @font-face {font-family:华文中宋; panose-1:2 1 6 0 4 1 1 1 1 1;} @font-face {font-family:仿宋; panose-1:2 1 6 9 6 1 1 1 1 1;} @font-face {font-family:华文仿宋; panose-1:2 1 6 0 4 1 1 1 1 1;} @font-face {font-family:Tahoma; panose-1:2 11 6 4 3 5 4 4 2 4;} @font-face {font-family:等线;} @font-face {font-family:"\@宋体"; panose-1:2 1 6 0 3 1 1 1 1 1;} @font-face {font-family:"\@仿宋"; panose-1:2 1 6 9 6 1 1 1 1 1;} @font-face {font-family:"\@黑体"; panose-1:2 1 6 9 6 1 1 1 1 1;} @font-face {font-family:"\@华文仿宋"; panose-1:2 1 6 0 4 1 1 1 1 1;} @font-face {font-family:"\@华文中宋"; panose-1:2 1 6 0 4 1 1 1 1 1;} @font-face {font-family:"\@仿宋_GB2312";} @font-face {font-family:"\@方正小标宋简体";} @font-face {font-family:"\@等线";}  /* Style Definitions */  p.MsoNormal, li.MsoNormal, div.MsoNormal {margin:0cm; margin-bottom:.0001pt; text-align:justify; text-justify:inter-ideograph; font-size:10.5pt; font-family:"Times New Roman","serif";} p.MsoHeader, li.MsoHeader, div.MsoHeader {margin:0cm; margin-bottom:.0001pt; text-align:center; vsb_temp-mode:char; border:none; padding:0cm; font-size:9.0pt; font-family:"Times New Roman","serif";} p.MsoFooter, li.MsoFooter, div.MsoFooter {margin:0cm; margin-bottom:.0001pt; vsb_temp-mode:char; font-size:9.0pt; font-family:"Times New Roman","serif";} p.MsoAcetate, li.MsoAcetate, div.MsoAcetate {margin:0cm; margin-bottom:.0001pt; text-align:justify; text-justify:inter-ideograph; font-size:9.0pt; font-family:"Times New Roman","serif";} p.MsoListParagraph, li.MsoListParagraph, div.MsoListParagraph {margin:0cm; margin-bottom:.0001pt; text-align:justify; text-justify:inter-ideograph; text-indent:21.0pt; font-size:10.5pt; font-family:等线;} p.Char1CharCharCharCharCharCharCharCharChar, li.Char1CharCharCharCharCharCharCharCharChar, div.Char1CharCharCharCharCharCharCharCharChar {mso-style-name:" Char1 Char Char Char Char Char Char Char Char Char"; margin:0cm; margin-bottom:.0001pt; text-align:justify; text-justify:inter-ideograph; font-size:12.0pt; font-family:"Tahoma","sans-serif";}  /* Page Definitions */  @page Section1 {size:595.3pt 841.9pt; margin:72.0pt 89.85pt 72.0pt 89.85pt; vsb_temp:15.6pt;} div.Section1 {page:Section1;}  /* List Definitions */  ol {margin-bottom:0cm;} ul {margin-bottom:0cm;} --></style>
<div class="Section1" style="vsb_temp: 15.6pt;">
 <p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">&nbsp;</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">&nbsp;</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 25pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">&nbsp;</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; line-height: 28pt;"><span style="background: white; color: black; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">各教育教学单位：</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="background: white; color: black; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">为增强学生实践能力，深化创新创业教育改革，提高学生国际素养和全球胜任力，<span lang="EN-US">2020</span>年持续开展主题为</span><span lang="EN-US" style="background: white; color: black; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16pt;">“</span><span style="background: white; color: black; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">拓展国际视野 增强实践能力</span><span lang="EN-US" style="background: white; color: black; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16pt;">”</span><span style="background: white; color: black; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">的国际双创实践周。现就做好国际双创实践周教育教学活动安排通知如下：</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="background: white; color: black; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">1.</span><span style="background: white; color: black; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">国际双创实践周（<span lang="EN-US">6</span>月<span lang="EN-US">15</span>日～<span lang="EN-US">6</span>月<span lang="EN-US">28</span>日）是正常教学时间，学生应该严格遵守教学秩序，按照国际双创实践周教学计划和活动安排完成相关学习任务。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="background: white; color: black; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">2.2017</span><span style="background: white; color: black; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">级（如参加生产实习或其他实习实践活动，不需参加校内活动）、<span lang="EN-US">2018</span>级与<span lang="EN-US">2019</span>级学生均须选修国际双创实践周的一门课程或参加其它活动（活动内容见附件）。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="background: white; color: black; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">&nbsp;</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="background: white; color: black; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">附件：国际双创实践周活动实施方案</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="background: white; color: black; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">&nbsp;</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: right; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="background: white; color: black; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">本科生院<span lang="EN-US">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: right; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="background: white; color: black; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">2020</span><span style="background: white; color: black; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">年<span lang="EN-US">6</span>月<span lang="EN-US">9</span>日</span></p>
 <span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;"><br clear="all" style="page-break-before: always;"> </span> 
 <p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">附件</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: center; line-height: 28pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 方正小标宋简体; font-size: 22pt;">2020</span><span style="font-family: 方正小标宋简体; font-size: 22pt;">年国际双创实践周活动实施方案</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 黑体; font-size: 16pt;">一、活动主旨</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">以形式多样、内容丰富的国际双创实践活动，为学生提供多样化的海外交流学习方式，开阔学生国际视野，满足学生国际化学习与发展需求，提高学生国际素养和全球胜任力，提升学校国际化育人能力。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 黑体; font-size: 16pt;">二、活动时间</span></p>
 <p class="MsoListParagraph" style="line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 0cm; margin-left: 36pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">2020</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">年<span lang="EN-US">6</span>月<span lang="EN-US">15</span>日——<span lang="EN-US">2020</span>年<span lang="EN-US">6</span>月<span lang="EN-US">28</span>日</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 黑体; font-size: 16pt;">三、活动主题</span></p>
 <p class="MsoListParagraph" style="line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 0cm; margin-left: 36pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">拓展国际视野<span lang="EN-US">&nbsp; </span>增强实践能力</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 黑体; font-size: 16pt;">四、活动对象</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32.1pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">2019</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">级、<span lang="EN-US">2018</span>级和<span lang="EN-US">2017</span>级本科生</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 黑体; font-size: 16pt;">五、活动内容</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">（一）课程类：</span></strong></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><strong><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">1.</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">海外专家线上课程</span></strong></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">项目介绍：</span></strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">各学院海外引课共计<span lang="EN-US">60</span>余门，供学生自由选课，学生按照教学计划上课，课程考核合格后，获得<span lang="EN-US">1-2</span>个选修课学分。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">负责单位：</span></strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">计划中心、运行中心、各学院</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><strong><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">2.</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">企业双创线上课程</span></strong></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">项目介绍：</span></strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">为提高学生创新创业意识，激发学生创新创业活力，在国际双创实践周开设<span lang="EN-US">39</span>门企业双创课程，由学校创新创业导师和企业导师来校授课，每门课程<span lang="EN-US">16</span>学时（<span lang="EN-US">1</span>学分），供学生自由选课，学生按照教学计划上课，课程考核合格后，获得<span lang="EN-US">1</span>个选修课学分。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">负责单位：</span></strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">创新创业学院、计划中心、运行中心</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">（二）活动类：</span></strong></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><strong><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">1.</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">“创响中国”西电站系列活动</span></strong></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">项目介绍：</span></strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">为全方位提升学生创新创业能力，提升学校创新创业质量，特开展“创响中国”西电站系列活动，包括<span lang="EN-US">2020</span>年度“大学生创新创业训练计划”国家级、省级项目遴选和答辩活动，双创示范基地“校企行”专项活动（荣事达、中国电科），创业合伙人—互联网<span lang="EN-US">+</span>大赛组队专场，创业公开课，“互联网<span lang="EN-US">+</span>”大赛专项打磨指导等。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">负责单位：</span></strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">创新创业学院</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><strong><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">2.</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">能力拓展系列线上讲座</span></strong></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">项目介绍：</span></strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">能力拓展系列讲座是各书院为促进学生全面发展，提高学生综合能力，特</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">邀请国内外学者、国际化专家、行业精英、杰出校友、创业者开展系列讲座。</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">包括海棠<span lang="EN-US">7</span>号书院美育小讲堂、海棠<span lang="EN-US">8</span>号书院杰出校友报告、海棠<span lang="EN-US">9</span>号书院“德显学术拓展计划”系列讲座、丁香<span lang="EN-US">1</span>号书院音乐与生活、职业与发展讲座、丁香<span lang="EN-US">2</span>号书院品悦丁香</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16pt;">•</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">分享者（双创周特辑）、校就业指导服务中心对于疫情影响下的就业形势分析及应对举措等。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">负责单位：</span></strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">各书院、就业指导服务中心</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32.1pt;"><strong><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">3.</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">大学生学科竞赛集训及赛事介绍</span></strong></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32.1pt;"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">项目介绍：</span></strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">组织专家教练对参加全国大学生电子设计竞赛省赛、全国大学生数模竞赛省赛等学科竞赛学生进行集中训练，根据学校有关规定，认定<span lang="EN-US">1</span>个选修课学分。组织<span lang="EN-US">8</span>个竞赛基地进行竞赛宣传。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32.1pt;"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">负责单位：</span></strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">运行中心</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32.1pt;"><strong><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">4.</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">科技创新能力核心素养线上培训</span></strong></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32.1pt;"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">项目介绍：</span></strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">为全方位提升学生科技创新成果转化、促进学生创业就业能力，开展科技创新能力核心素养线上培训，主要内容包括演讲口才的机制与艺术、职业礼仪与修养、项目分析与商业计划书、创新创业中的设计美学、数据库与商业智能等方面，是“挑战杯”“创青春”“星火杯”等校内外大型课外学术科技作品竞赛和创业计划竞赛的重要学习项目。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32.1pt;"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">负责单位：</span></strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">校团委</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><strong><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">5.</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">全球胜任力菁英青年高峰论坛（线上）</span></strong></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">项目介绍：</span></strong><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">2020</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">年第二届全球胜任力菁英青年高峰论坛（线上）的主题是“后疫情时期全球青年责任”，共计两场，将邀请约<span lang="EN-US">30</span>名海内外菁英青年就今年的论坛主题作为嘉宾自选题目发出属于青年人的声音，助力营造学校国际化氛围，扩大西电在海内外青年菁英中的声誉，为我校吸引世界一流人才提供平台。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">负责单位：</span></strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">国际合作与交流部</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><strong><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">6.</span></strong> <a name="_Hlk42530856"></a><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">心理健康线上讲座</span></strong></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">项目介绍：</span></strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">针对后疫情时期的学生心理状况，心理健康教育中心于<span lang="EN-US">6</span>月<span lang="EN-US">15</span>日<span lang="EN-US">-6</span>月<span lang="EN-US">24</span>日举办<span lang="EN-US">5</span>场讲座，包括情绪管理、心理调适技巧、</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16pt;">返校后的寝室关系处理技巧、后疫情时期的目标管理与时间管理、以积极情绪理性应对疫情</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">等。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">负责单位：</span></strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16pt;">心理健康教育中心</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
</div></div><div id="div_vote_id"></div></DIV>
        
